{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legacy of Shadows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decaying mansion deep in the mountains. Leftover relics. And a lingering, ominous presence\u2014<br>You inherit your late uncle\u2019s house, only to discover it comes with a crushing debt.<br>What was supposed to be a visit to sell off the remaining valuables and repay what you owe...<br>turns into something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, collect, and survive.<br>Can you navigate the mansion, gather valuable items, and make it out safely?<br>As you delve deeper, the house\u2019s buried past begins to reveal itself...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tense Exploration</strong> \u2013 A survival experience where every item you collect could be your last.<br>\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Lurking Terror</strong> \u2013 Evade the shadows that wander the halls of the mansion.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Debt Repayment as Goal</strong> \u2013 Sell what you find and aim for financial freedom.<br>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Uncovered Truths</strong> \u2013 The items you collect start to whisper secrets of a long-held grudge.<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Growth &amp; Choice</strong> \u2013 Learn new skills through exploration and tailor your growth to your playstyle.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Competition &amp; Challenge</strong> \u2013 Compete with others in clear time and score for replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you repay the debt and escape the mansion?<br>Or will you be swallowed by the shadows\u2014?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604960/bfbf107d749b9b409394cb5a33710f4cf0fdd18a.jpg"},{"name":"Overcoming the Trial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604960/5b3f3e867c810656caf02f9cd8ac92bb8b040cd5.jpg"},{"name":"Survivo